  <!-- The built-in Clean target only removes files MSBuild itself produced (tracked via .tlog);
       it has no knowledge of the CryptoAPI_static.* files rename_output.bat copies into $(OutDir)
       as a PostBuildEvent, so Clean would otherwise leave them behind as stale orphans. -->
